<title>USA: Hughes Supply seeks to acquire Dixie Forming.</title>
<headline>Hughes Supply seeks to acquire Dixie Forming.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Supply Inc said on Thursday it filed a letter of intent to acquire Dixie Forming and Building Specialties Inc. for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Hughes said the acquisition would be accretive to its earnings per share. The transaction was expected to close on or about February 10.</p>
<p>Dixie, of Raleigh, N.C., had sales of $21 million in the most recent fiscal year. Its current owners would continue to manage it after the acquisition.</p>
